    {
      "data": {
        "text": "StatCraft v0.2.2 publishes the comprehensive, exhaustive bilingual feature catalog documentation ([`docs/FEATURES.md`](docs/FEATURES.md) and [`docs/FEATURES_RU.md`](docs/FEATURES_RU.md)) covering all analytical, data manipulation, and transformation procedures implemented across the entire application, alongside version synchronization and automated release packaging."
      },
      "id": "blk_native_paragraph_1793994630665225500",
      "managed_by": "project_parser",
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "data": {
        "level": 3,
        "text": "📖 Comprehensive Feature Guide (`FEATURES.md` & `FEATURES_RU.md`)"
      },
      "id": "blk_native_heading_1793994630665226000",
      "managed_by": "project_parser",
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "data": {
        "text": "* Published detailed, end-to-end documentation of every feature available in StatCraft v0.2.2:\n  * **Dual-View Data Management:** Streaming CSV/TSV reader, Microsoft Excel reader (Calamine), Data View virtualized tabular grid with inline editing, row strike-through for filtered cases, and Variable View supporting all 9 canonical SPSS types, value labels, and missing value ranges.\n  * **Data Manipulation Suite (Data Menu):** Multi-column stable case sorting (`Sort Cases`), conditional case filtering (`Select Cases`), subgroup stratification (`Split File`), and frequency/sampling case weighting (`Weight Cases`).\n  * **Complete Transformation Suite (Transform Menu):** Variable computation (`Compute Variable` via RPN parser), in-place and target recoding (`Recode`), automatic integer recoding (`Automatic Recode`), lead/lag shifts (`Shift Values`), case value counting (`Count Values`), dummy variable generation (`Create Dummy Variables`), missing value imputation (`Replace Missing Values`), time series filters (`Create Time Series`), visual & optimal binning (`Visual Binning` & `Optimal Binning`), rank cases (`Rank Cases` with tie adjustments and normal scores), date/time wizard (`Date and Time Wizard`), automated data preparation (`ADP`), and programmability scripts (`Programmability Transformations`).\n  * **Statistical Calculation Suite (Analyze Menu):** Descriptives, Frequencies, Crosstabs (with $\\chi^2$, Fisher's exact, Likelihood Ratio, and Cramér's $V$), Means breakdown with ANOVA and $\\eta^2$, One-Sample $t$-test, Independent-Samples $t$-test (with Levene's test and Welch's $t$), Paired-Samples $t$-test, One-Way ANOVA, Bivariate Correlations (Pearson $r$, Spearman $\\rho$, Kendall $\\tau_b$), Nonparametric tests (Mann-Whitney $U$, Kruskal-Wallis $H$, Wilcoxon Signed-Rank, and Sign test), Multiple Linear Regression (OLS/WLS with Collinearity Tolerance & VIF), Scale Reliability Analysis (Cronbach's $\\alpha$ and Item-Total statistics), and Factor Analysis / PCA (with KMO, Bartlett's test, and Component Matrix).\n  * **Output Viewer & Export:** Authentic multi-tier SPSS Pivot Tables with one-click TSV clipboard export for Excel, collapsible Outline navigation tree, and command syntax execution logging.\n  * **SPSS Command Syntax & Agent Readiness:** Batch `.sps` syntax execution, script file loading/saving, non-destructive Undo/Redo (`Ctrl+Z` / `Ctrl+Y`), and typed parameter schemas `specs()` for AI agents."
      },
      "id": "blk_native_paragraph_1793994630665228300",
      "managed_by": "project_parser",
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "data": {
        "level": 3,
        "text": "📦 Multi-Platform Artifacts"
      },
      "id": "blk_native_heading_1793994630665229000",
      "managed_by": "project_parser",
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "data": {
        "text": "* **Windows (x64):** Inno Setup Installer (`.exe`) + Portable ZIP archive.\n* **Linux (x64):** Debian package (`.deb`) + Portable TAR.GZ archive.\n* **macOS (Apple Silicon ARM64 & Intel x64):** Apple DMG Disk Image + Application Bundle (`.app`) TAR.GZ."
      },
